              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Ebyahandiikirwe bikatwarira hamwe byona kutegyekwa ekibi, ngu abarikwikiriza baheebwe ebyaraganisiibwe ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
